node 451 · 451 · ⟦Guy Montag:451:13b164⟧

WHO   — Guy Montag — the fireman who woke
WHAT  — The protagonist's awakening: jolted by Clarisse and a burning woman, he steals books, kills his chief, and flees to the Book People.
WHERE — 451 · FAHRENHEIT 451  Framework inputs: Fahrenheit 451 (Ray Bradbury, 1953)  Conductor / external anchor: ROOT0 (catalogued into UD0)
WHY   — Because the warning needs one mind inside the machine that starts, against everything, to read.
HOW   — By a stolen book, a guilty curiosity, a hidden ally in Faber, and a final break and flight from the Hound.

awareness — what the node knows of itself:
  I burned books for a living and called it pleasure — until a girl asked if I was happy, and a woman chose the fire, and I had to know what was inside.

